{
  "key": 54363,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_SaturnIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "You... You came all the way here\n",
        "just to save some Pokémon?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_WhatMakesYouSoTough",
      "en_US": [
        "...Gah!\n",
        "What makes you so tough?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_PressButtonAndFreePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Press the button and set them free.\n",
        "Isn’t that why you came?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_BossCraftedRedChain",
      "en_US": [
        "Our boss crafted a Red Chain from\n",
        "crystals he took from the three\f",
        "Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_PressButtonAndFreePokemon2",
      "en_US": [
        "Press the button and set them free.\n",
        "Isn’t that why you came?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_WhereWouldTheyGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Charon: Fuhyahya!\r",
        "Those Pokémon of the lakes, where do\n",
        "you suppose they would go?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_WhatAreYouSaying",
      "en_US": "Saturn: What are you trying to say?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_ILookForwardToPlan",
      "en_US": [
        "Charon: Nothing.\n",
        "Pay it no heed.\r",
        "A new world isn’t overly interesting.\n",
        "What of it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_BossCanDoWithoutSupport",
      "en_US": [
        "Saturn: Gramps.\r",
        "Our boss can do without your kind of\n",
        "moral support."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_PerhapsAnotherOption",
      "en_US": [
        "Charon: Humph. Saturn and even Cyrus\n",
        "fall to a mere child...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_AskPressButton",
      "en_US": [
        "Press the button and set\n",
        "the Pokémon free?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_PlayerPressedButton",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} pressed the button and\n",
        "set the Pokémon free.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_AlreadyPressedButton",
      "en_US": [
        "The button has been pressed already.\n",
        "You have to leave."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_UxieIsSealedInside",
      "en_US": [
        "UXIE is sealed inside! It appears to\n",
        "be suffering, with eyes squeezed shut."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_MespritIsSealedInside",
      "en_US": [
        "MESPRIT is sealed inside! It seems to\n",
        "be suffering, with its tail twitching."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_AzelfIsSealedInside",
      "en_US": [
        "AZELF is sealed inside! It appears to\n",
        "be suffering, with wracking shudders."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_UxieWasSealedInside",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s Team Galactic’s sinister machine.\n",
        "UXIE had been sealed inside it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_MespritWasSealedInside",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s Team Galactic’s sinister machine.\n",
        "MESPRIT had been sealed inside it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQControlRoom_Text_AzelfWasSealedInside",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s Team Galactic’s sinister machine.\n",
        "AZELF had been sealed inside it."
      ]
    }
  ]
